---
source: misc/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help_output(\"uuidparse\")"
---
A utility to parse unique identifiers

Usage: uuidparse [OPTIONS] [UUIDS]...

Arguments:
  [UUIDS]...  UUIDs to parse

Options:
  -J, --json             Use JSON output format
  -n, --noheadings       Do not print a header line
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>  Specify which output columns to print (UUID,VARIANT,TYPE,TIME)
  -r, --raw              Use the raw output format
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version

Available output columns:
     UUID  unique identifier
  VARIANT  variant name
     TYPE  type name
     TIME  timestamp
